                                          AIFeatureToggleModel + InMemory source) with an optimistic
                                          setFeature(id:isOn:) that updates locally then forwards the command;
                                          P1/S11 telemetry seam (AIFeatureToggleTelemetry + OSLog sink,
                                          view.opened surface="AIFeatureToggleList" emitted once on first
                                          presentation); P1/S10 AIFeatureToggleStrings facade; the input
                                          snapshot + resolved view-state; the stale one-shot auto-refresh.
  AIFeatureToggleList.Views.swift       — the legend subhead, the toggle row (label + description + label-less
                                          switch bound to model.setFeature, carrying the feature label as its
                                          a11y label + ai-feature-row/-toggle accessibility identifiers), the
