  AIFeatureToggleList.strings           — the P1/S10 catalog: the parity legend + the native leaf chrome keys.
                                          The per-feature label/description keys are per-registry-entry and
                                          arrive as data (registry fallback), so they are intentionally not
                                          enumerated — exactly like the web.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  — registry/settings resolving with no rows yet → skeleton rows.
  empty    — resolved with no registry rows → friendly message, never a blank section.
  error    — settings fetch failure → retry affordance (P4 leaf addition; the web is always handed props).
  data     — the registry-mapped toggle rows.
  stale / offline — orthogonal connection axis → header freshness chip + banner; stale auto-refreshes once.

